WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:14.764
We sat on the steps.

2
00:00:15.864 --> 00:00:17.845
Molly put her chin in her hands.

3
00:00:17.865 --> 00:00:20.946
"I don't want to give Tufty away.

4
00:00:21.306 --> 00:00:23.726
But I don't think he's going to learn to talk."

5
00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:27.087
"Don't worry," I said.

6
00:00:27.107 --> 00:00:29.108
"I'll think of something else."

7
00:00:30.536 --> 00:00:31.377
Molly smiled.

8
00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:34.680
She felt better, but I felt worried.

9
00:00:35.961 --> 00:00:38.523
How could I keep Tufty from making noise?

10
00:00:39.624 --> 00:00:44.167
Just then we heard the scream of a fire engine siren from Molly's apartment!

11
00:00:48.771 --> 00:00:49.612
"Oh no!

12
00:00:49.832 --> 00:00:51.273
Tufty's doing it again!"

13
00:00:51.794 --> 00:00:52.474
cried Molly.

14
00:00:52.494 --> 00:00:56.337
"I hope the fire department doesn't hear him," said Josh.

15
00:00:56.357 --> 00:00:59.260
"They'll think there's a real fire somewhere!"

16
00:01:00.944 --> 00:01:04.405
On the sidewalk two boys were squirting each other with a hose.

17
00:01:05.325 --> 00:01:07.086
They squirted some water on us.

18
00:01:07.106 --> 00:01:10.907
"That feels nice and cool!"

19
00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:11.907
said Jenny.

20
00:01:11.927 --> 00:01:15.668
"Just like at the movies," I said.

21
00:01:17.649 --> 00:01:19.289
Mrs. Carroll came outside.

22
00:01:20.669 --> 00:01:23.030
She was carrying a box of old DVDs.

23
00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:26.311
The word "Free" was written on the box.

24
00:01:26.331 --> 00:01:30.764
"I'm giving these away," she told us.

25
00:01:30.784 --> 00:01:33.945
"You kids can have them, if you'd like.

26
00:01:34.405 --> 00:01:35.606
My son is grown up now.

27
00:01:36.006 --> 00:01:37.466
He doesn't watch them anymore."

28
00:01:39.287 --> 00:01:41.747
We took the DVDs from her and looked at them.

29
00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:46.288
"It's The Magic Music Box!"

30
00:01:46.829 --> 00:01:47.469
said Jenny.

31
00:01:47.489 --> 00:01:49.709
"I love that movie."

32
00:01:49.729 --> 00:01:53.950
"It has a lot of great songs in it," said Molly.

33
00:01:54.851 --> 00:01:55.791
Beep! Beep!

34
00:01:56.091 --> 00:01:59.392
From Molly's apartment came the sound of a taxi honking.

35
00:02:00.684 --> 00:02:03.086
"There goes Tufty again!"

36
00:02:03.546 --> 00:02:04.406
said Caswell.

37
00:02:05.407 --> 00:02:07.487
Suddenly I got an idea.

38
00:02:07.507 --> 00:02:13.190
"Maybe The Magic Music Box will keep Tufty quiet," I said.

39
00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:16.211
"At least until I can think of something else.

40
00:02:16.631 --> 00:02:18.412
We can watch the movie on a computer."

41
00:02:22.554 --> 00:02:24.375
We walked upstairs to my apartment.

42
00:02:25.415 --> 00:02:28.240
On the way we got Tufty.

43
00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:31.281
I asked my mom if I could borrow her spray bottle of water.

44
00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:34.122
She uses it for her plants.

45
00:02:34.142 --> 00:02:38.463
"Now everyone go into my room," I said.

46
00:02:38.483 --> 00:02:43.244
"We're going to watch a movie in an air-conditioned theater!"

47
00:02:43.264 --> 00:02:46.925
"Air-conditioned?" Jenny echoed.

48
00:02:46.945 --> 00:02:48.806
"But Mr.

49
00:02:48.866 --> 00:02:51.886
Calabria said we couldn't use air conditioners yet."

50
00:02:51.906 --> 00:02:53.887
"You'll see!"

51
00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:55.067
I promised her.

52
00:02:56.307 --> 00:02:57.948
We all squeezed into my bedroom.

53
00:03:01.193 --> 00:03:03.434
"It's crowded in here!"

54
00:03:03.795 --> 00:03:04.575
Jenny giggled.

55
00:03:04.595 --> 00:03:08.138
"It's hot too," added Josh.

56
00:03:10.259 --> 00:03:11.320
I turned on my fan.

57
00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:14.182
"Who wants to get cool first?"

58
00:03:18.866 --> 00:03:19.946
shouted Caswell.

59
00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:22.849
I turned the fan towards Caswell.

60
00:03:23.869 --> 00:03:27.132
Then, standing behind it, I squirted him with water from the bottle.

61
00:03:28.192 --> 00:03:31.033
The fan sprayed the water all over him!

62
00:03:31.053 --> 00:03:33.054
"That feels good!"

63
00:03:33.514 --> 00:03:34.435
cried Caswell.

64
00:03:35.995 --> 00:03:39.217
We took turns using my fan and spraying each other with water.

65
00:03:39.237 --> 00:03:42.598
"Be careful of the computer!"

66
00:03:42.978 --> 00:03:43.999
I shouted, laughing.

67
00:03:44.019 --> 00:03:46.900
"And don't get my boot wet!"

68
00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:47.900
cried Molly.

69
00:03:49.081 --> 00:03:50.481
The water felt great.

70
00:03:51.722 --> 00:03:52.882
Even Tufty loved it!

71
00:03:54.603 --> 00:03:56.324
Soon we started watching the movie.

72
00:03:57.332 --> 00:03:58.252
Molly was right.

73
00:03:58.793 --> 00:04:01.194
The movie did have lots of great songs.

74
00:04:02.434 --> 00:04:04.215
I really liked "Telephone Number."

75
00:04:05.315 --> 00:04:07.796
You can sing any phone number with that song.

76
00:04:09.097 --> 00:04:16.320
I sang Molly and Caswell's telephone number: You can sing And you can sing your number And put

77
00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.340
it in a song.

78
00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.101
My number is 555...

79
00:04:19.201 --> 00:04:20.622
I never get it wrong!

80
00:04:22.342 --> 00:04:25.864
After the movie was over, we kept singing the song with Molly's number.

81
00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.801
We sang over and over while we sprayed each other with water.

82
00:04:30.861 --> 00:04:34.642
We were having so much fun that we forgot all about Tufty.

83
00:04:37.943 --> 00:04:39.944
Suddenly Molly stopped singing.

84
00:04:40.424 --> 00:04:41.204
She looked around.

85
00:04:41.224 --> 00:04:43.565
"Where's Tufty?"

86
00:04:44.005 --> 00:04:44.525
she said.

87
00:04:44.545 --> 00:04:48.486
"He was here a minute ago," said Josh.

88
00:04:48.506 --> 00:04:54.228
"He couldn't have flown into the kitchen," I said, glancing at my bedroom door.

89
00:04:54.948 --> 00:04:55.688
It was closed.

90
00:04:57.024 --> 00:04:59.786
We looked under my bed and behind my dresser.

91
00:05:00.987 --> 00:05:02.889
But there was no sign of Tufty.

92
00:05:03.789 --> 00:05:05.591
Then Josh pointed upward.

93
00:05:06.992 --> 00:05:10.955
"Iggy, your skylight is open," he said.

94
00:05:13.877 --> 00:05:16.119
Molly's face turned white.

95
00:05:16.139 --> 00:05:18.300
"Oh no!"

96
00:05:18.961 --> 00:05:19.822
she cried.

97
00:05:19.842 --> 00:05:22.203
"Tufty flew away!"
